<![CDATA[ <p><strong style="color: rgb(13, 13, 13);">Position: </strong><span style="color: rgb(13, 13, 13);">Blaster</span></p><p><strong style="color: rgb(13, 13, 13);">Location: </strong><span style="color: rgb(13, 13, 13);">Tulsa, OK</span></p><p><strong style="color: rgb(13, 13, 13);">Pay:</strong><span style="color: rgb(13, 13, 13);"> $</span><span style="color: rgb(50, 81, 104); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">18/hour</span></p><p><strong style="color: rgb(13, 13, 13);">Experience: </strong><span style="color: rgb(50, 81, 104); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Previous experience in industrial blasting, painting, or surface preparation preferred. </span></p><p><strong style="color: rgb(13, 13, 13);">Type: </strong><span style="color: rgb(13, 13, 13);">Full-time; Contract </span></p><p><strong style="color: rgb(13, 13, 13);">Schedule:</strong><span style="color: rgb(50, 81, 104); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">, Monday - Thursday, 4:30pm to 3:00am</span></p><p><span style="color: rgb(13, 13, 13);">&nbsp;</span></p><p><strong style="color: rgb(13, 13, 13);">ProRecruiters </strong><span style="color: rgb(13, 13, 13);">is seeking a&nbsp;</span><strong style="color: rgb(13, 13, 13);">Blaster</strong><span style="color: rgb(13, 13, 13);">&nbsp;to join a growing and dynamic team!&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style="color: rgb(13, 13, 13);">&nbsp;</span></p><p><strong style="color: rgb(13, 13, 13);">Job Description:</strong><span style="color: rgb(13, 13, 13);"> </span></p><ol><li data-list="bullet"><span class="ql-ui" contenteditable="false"></span>Operate sandblasting or other abrasive blasting equipment to clean and prepare surfaces.</li><li data-list="bullet"><span class="ql-ui" contenteditable="false"></span>Inspect surfaces to ensure proper preparation before coating or painting.</li><li data-list="bullet"><span class="ql-ui" contenteditable="false"></span>Maintain and clean blasting equipment and work area.</li><li data-list="bullet"><span class="ql-ui" contenteditable="false"></span>Follow all safety procedures, including PPE usage and hazardous material handling.</li><li data-list="bullet"><span class="ql-ui" contenteditable="false"></span>Work efficiently to meet production and quality goals.</li></ol><p> </p><p><strong style="color: rgb(13, 13, 13);">Position Requirements: </strong><span style="color: rgb(13, 13, 13);">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><ol><li data-list="bullet"><span class="ql-ui" contenteditable="false"></span>Knowledge of abrasive media, surface profiles, and blasting techniques.</li><li data-list="bullet"><span class="ql-ui" contenteditable="false"></span>Ability to lift up to 50 lbs. and work in various environments (indoor/outdoor).</li><li data-list="bullet"><span class="ql-ui" contenteditable="false"></span>Strong attention to detail and commitment to safety.</li></ol><p> </p><p><strong style="color: rgb(13, 13, 13);">ProRecruiters </strong><span style="color: rgb(13, 13, 13);">is part of</span><strong style="color: rgb(13, 13, 13);"> Array Corporation,</strong><span style="color: rgb(13, 13, 13);"> the leading technology-enabled workforce solutions company whose mission is to fix how work is bought, sold and delivered to enable access to the American Dream. </span></p><p><br></p><p><em style="color: rgb(13, 13, 13);">We are proud to be an Equal Employment Opportunity and Affirmative Action employer. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, disability or veteran status.</em></p><p><br></p><p>#PRLAB</p> ]]>
